Use the Profiler to record the run-times and the call frequency of the Methods which are executed in
your simulation model. This way you can detect which Methods consume the most time and find out how
changes in modeling affect the performance of your model.
To change the length of the graphic and the anchor points of the Method, click Show Manipulators 
on the Edit ribbon tab or press M on the keyboard.
Add the Object to the Simulation Model
To add the object Method to your simulation model, click 
  Manage Class Library > Basic Objects >
InformationFlow > Method on the Home ribbon tab.
