States of the Method
During the simulation runs Plant Simulation shows the state of the Methods with colored rectangles in
the display area along the upper border of their pictures in the Frame.
Description Method shows a
The source code contains syntax errors red rectangle
The source code is being executed green rectangle
Has been suspended by a stopuntil or a waituntil
instruction
purple rectangle
Has been suspended by a wait instruction blue rectangle
The source code is encrypted dark gray rectangle
The source code is inherited dark green rectangle
